The GeoFS Global Traffic addon is a massive, performance-optimized JavaScript extension that brings the world of GeoFS to life. Featuring a staggering **1,247 unique, hand-placed models**, this addon dynamically populates the environment around you as you fly, offering unprecedented immersion without tanking your framerate.

Designed for ease of use, it injects a custom control panel directly into your native GeoFS settings menu, allowing you to manage traffic density and toggle the system on the fly.

